  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2021 Support to strengthen UN Peace Operations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to strengthen UN peace operations through 7 individual projects: 1) strengthening the protection of civilians (POC), 2) using data and technology to enhance performance on the POC, 3) advancing the implementation of the conflict-related sexual violence mandate, 4) better leveraging informal dispute mechanisms to support local conflict management, 5) support for the development of thematic manuals under the strategic guidance framework for international policing, 6) strengthening operational impact on Women, Peace and Security (WPS) mandates and 6) support to DPO COVID-19 response.</narrative>
  </description>
